# Suspicious Active Directory Database Snapshot Via ADExplorer | T1069.002, T1087.002, T1482 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_sysinternals_adexplorer_susp_execution.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image IN ("*\\ADExp.exe", "*\\ADExplorer.exe", "*\\ADExplorer64.exe", "*\\ADExplorer64a.exe") OR OriginalFileName="AdExp" OR Description="Active Directory Editor" OR Product="Sysinternals ADExplorer") CommandLine="*snapshot*" (CommandLine IN ("*\\Downloads\\*", "*\\Users\\Public\\*", "*\\AppData\\*", "*\\Windows\\Temp\\*"))
